  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 2585,
      "text": "They will not hear its slightest hissing, and they will abide forever in whatever their souls desire.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 102,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 331,
      "ruku": 284,
      "hizbQuarter": 132,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2586,
      "text": "They will not be grieved by the Greatest Terror[43], and the angels will receive them [saying], “This is your Day that you were promised”.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 103,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 331,
      "ruku": 284,
      "hizbQuarter": 132,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2587,
      "text": "On the Day when We roll up the heavens like a scroll of records. Just as We originated the first creation, so We will bring it back. That is Our binding promise, which We will surely do.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 104,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 331,
      "ruku": 284,
      "hizbQuarter": 132,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2588,
      "text": "We have written in the Psalms[44] after the Preserved Record[45], that the land will be inherited by My righteous slaves.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 105,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 331,
      "ruku": 284,
      "hizbQuarter": 132,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2589,
      "text": "Indeed, there is a message in this [Qur’an] for devoted worshipers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 106,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 331,
      "ruku": 284,
      "hizbQuarter": 132,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2590,
      "text": "We have not sent you [O Prophet] except as a mercy to the worlds.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 107,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 331,
      "ruku": 284,
      "hizbQuarter": 132,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2591,
      "text": "Say, “It is only revealed to me that your God is only One God; will you then submit to Him?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 108,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 331,
      "ruku": 284,
      "hizbQuarter": 132,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2592,
      "text": "But if they turn away, say, “I have proclaimed the message to you all alike[46], and I do not know whether what you are warned of[47] is near or far.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 109,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 331,
      "ruku": 284,
      "hizbQuarter": 132,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2593,
      "text": "Indeed, He knows what is said openly and knows what you conceal.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 110,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 331,
      "ruku": 284,
      "hizbQuarter": 132,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2594,
      "text": "I do not know; perhaps this [delay][48] is a test for you[49] and an enjoyment for a while.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 111,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 331,
      "ruku": 284,
      "hizbQuarter": 132,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2595,
      "text": "[The Prophet] said, “My Lord, judge [between us] in truth. Our Lord is the Most Compassionate Whose help is to be sought against what you describe[50].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
